# Riverglades - Recipes & Patterns companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Only recipes, patterns and schematics whose SOURCE is physically in
# Riverglades, verified against the local Forever game data (questie-forever
# item vendor tables). Fifteen recipes are vendor-sold by in-zone vendors:
# the Powderfuse Port (neutral east-hub) vendors Fimbo Greasemitz, Gritta
# Chumwater, Grizzek, Innkeeper Zizplink, Stitch Pinwizzle, Kor'gar and
# Fizzix Boomshot, and the southern Turner-farm (Alliance) vendors Miranda
# Turner and Martha Wellsworth - Martha is the only vendor anywhere for her
# two plans. No mob-dropped recipe has an in-zone dropper anywhere in the
# data, so this guide is vendor-only. The Horde-hub vendor Naluk's sole
# stock is excluded (Alterac precedent - see
# docs/riverglades-companions-inventory.md and docs/companion-unverified.md).
# Trainer-taught staples are excluded: Polestar's own profession guides
# cover those. Each step is gated to its profession; other characters skip
# it cleanly. Alchemy, Enchanting, First Aid, Fishing and Leatherworking
# have no Riverglades source, so that is stated, not padded.
guide butler-routes-completionist/riverglades-recipes
title Riverglades - Recipes & Patterns
levels 36-45
zone Riverglades
faction Alliance
category Professions
folder Companions
keywords riverglades, recipes, patterns, professions, companions
coords live
version 1

step Powderfuse Port vendors - Fimbo's stock (Cooking)

  zone map 2548

  when skill Cooking 1

  tip Fimbo Greasemitz (79.02, 54.20) sells recipes at Powderfuse Port; Miranda Turner at the southern Turner farm sells the same two.
  buy 21099 "Recipe: Smoked Sagefish"
  buy 21219 "Recipe: Sagefish Delight"
  note Stock class is unconfirmed in the data (no limited flag either way).

step Powderfuse Port vendors - Gritta's stock (Cooking)

  zone map 2548

  when skill Cooking 1

  tip Gritta Chumwater (around 77-80, 52-54) sells recipes at Powderfuse Port.
  buy 6330 "Recipe: Bristle Whisker Catfish"
  buy 6368 "Recipe: Rainbow Fin Albacore"
  note Stock class is unconfirmed in the data (no limited flag either way).

