step Turner farm vendor - Martha's stock (Blacksmithing)

  zone map 2548

  when skill Blacksmithing 1

  tip Martha Wellsworth (around 63-65, 82-86) sells plans at the southern Turner farm; she is the only vendor anywhere for both.
  buy 251460 "Plans: Mithril Warhammer"
  buy 274977 "Recipe: Plain Ol' Paletusk"
  note Stock class is unconfirmed in the data (no limited flag either way).

step No Riverglades source - Alchemy
  note Alchemy has no recipe source physically in Riverglades in the data - no vendor sells them here and no in-zone mob drops them - so this guide carries nothing for it. Polestar's own profession guides cover trainer-taught staples.

